{"candidateAnswer":"June 10, 2022, as a surprise gift after her screenplay got accepted.","evidence":"[D13:9 | 3:00 pm on 25 May, 2022] Nate: Yep, Joanna. It's great! Looky here, I got this new pup for you!\n[D24:2 | 2:01 pm on 21 October, 2022] Joanna: Hey Nate! I have been revising and perfecting the recipe I made for my family and it turned out really tasty. What's been happening with you?","itemId":"urn:uuid:f9537049-9f78-5892-ba01-1aabc16cfbb2","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:1afb10b2e9c99f28834886c786dda5637704be41f3ea51ee30ce300c15b4d8d1","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did Nate get Tilly for Joanna?","referenceAnswer":"25 May, 2022","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"1afb10b2e9c99f28834886c786dda5637704be41f3ea51ee30ce300c15b4d8d1"}}]}